{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "article": {
    "id": "re-foundations-1a-a-mysterious-visitor",
    "title": "RE Foundations / 1A / A Mysterious Visitor",
    "text_type": "informational",
    "audience": {
      "grade_band": "upper_elementary"
    },
    "language": "en"
  },
  "content": {
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "order": 1,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s1",
            "text": "In October 2017, astronomers in Hawaii saw something surprising."
          },
          {
            "id": "s2",
            "text": "A strange object was moving through the solar system."
          },
          {
            "id": "s3",
            "text": "They had seen many asteroids before, but this was something different."
          },
          {
            "id": "s4",
            "text": "It was long and thin —like a cucumber."
          },
          {
            "id": "s5",
            "text": "The object’s speed and direction also showed something surprising."
          },
          {
            "id": "s6",
            "text": "This was an interstellar 1 object—the first ever seen."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "order": 2,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s7",
            "text": "The object was named ‘Oumuamua—Hawaiian for “visitor from afar.”"
          },
          {
            "id": "s8",
            "text": "Nobody is sure exactly what it is."
          },
          {
            "id": "s9",
            "text": "The simplest idea is that ‘Oumuamua is a strangely shaped piece of rock."
          },
          {
            "id": "s10",
            "text": "Perhaps it was knocked out of a far-off star system."
          },
          {
            "id": "s11",
            "text": "However, astronomers saw that its speed increased after passing the sun."
          },
          {
            "id": "s12",
            "text": "Some scientists therefore suggest a different theory."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "order": 3,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s13",
            "text": "“’Oumuamua could be a piece of alien technology,” says Professor Abraham Loeb from Harvard University."
          },
          {
            "id": "s14",
            "text": "Loeb believes this could explain the object’s long, thin shape, and also its change in speed."
          },
          {
            "id": "s15",
            "text": "Maybe ‘Oumuamua was a spaceship that came to explore our solar system."
          },
          {
            "id": "s16",
            "text": "“All possibilities should be considered,” says Loeb."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "order": 4,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s17",
            "text": "‘Oumuamua can no longer be seen from Earth."
          },
          {
            "id": "s18",
            "text": "But astronomers continue to study the information they got from it."
          },
          {
            "id": "s19",
            "text": "It is still not clear if the object was a large rock, or something else altogether."
          },
          {
            "id": "s20",
            "text": "‘Oumuamua will likely be a mystery for many years to come."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "analysis": {
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "topic": {
          "label": "发现神秘天体"
        },
        "main_idea": {
          "text": "天文学家在夏威夷发现了一个形状和运动方式都很奇怪的星际物体。"
        },
        "key_details": [
          {
            "source_ids": [
              "s4"
            ],
            "meaning": "物体细长，像黄瓜一样。"
          },
          {
            "source_ids": [
              "s5"
            ],
            "meaning": "物体的速度和方向表现出令人惊讶的特征。"
          },
          {
            "source_ids": [
              "s6"
            ],
            "meaning": "这是人类首次发现的星际物体。"
          }
        ],
        "function": {
          "type": "introduction"
        },
        "relation_to_previous": null,
        "signals": [
          {
            "text": "something surprising",
            "source_id": "s1",
            "role": "hook"
          },
          {
            "text": "something different",
            "source_id": "s3",
            "role": "contrast"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "topic": {
          "label": "命名与初步理论"
        },
        "main_idea": {
          "text": "该物体被命名为“奥陌陌”，科学家对其本质有不同猜测，因为它的速度变化不符合普通岩石的特征。"
        },
        "key_details": [
          {
            "source_ids": [
              "s7"
            ],
            "meaning": "名字“奥陌陌”在夏威夷语中意为“来自远方的访客”。"
          },
          {
            "source_ids": [
              "s9"
            ],
            "meaning": "最简单的想法是它是一块形状奇怪的岩石。"
          },
          {
            "source_ids": [
              "s11"
            ],
            "meaning": "经过太阳后，它的速度增加了。"
          }
        ],
        "function": {
          "type": "explanation"
        },
        "relation_to_previous": {
          "type": "elaboration",
          "target": "p1"
        },
        "signals": [
          {
            "text": "Nobody is sure",
            "source_id": "s8",
            "role": "uncertainty"
          },
          {
            "text": "However",
            "source_id": "s11",
            "role": "transition"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "topic": {
          "label": "外星技术假说"
        },
        "main_idea": {
          "text": "哈佛大学教授Loeb提出，奥陌陌可能是外星技术，这能解释其形状和速度变化。"
        },
        "key_details": [
          {
            "source_ids": [
              "s13"
            ],
            "meaning": "Loeb教授认为它可能是外星技术的一部分。"
          },
          {
            "source_ids": [
              "s14"
            ],
            "meaning": "这一理论解释了其细长形状和速度变化。"
          },
          {
            "source_ids": [
              "s15"
            ],
            "meaning": "它可能是一艘来探索我们太阳系的飞船。"
          }
        ],
        "function": {
          "type": "argument"
        },
        "relation_to_previous": {
          "type": "contrast",
          "target": "p2"
        },
        "signals": [
          {
            "text": "says",
            "source_id": "s13",
            "role": "attribution"
          },
          {
            "text": "believes",
            "source_id": "s14",
            "role": "opinion"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "topic": {
          "label": "持续研究与未解之谜"
        },
        "main_idea": {
          "text": "虽然奥陌陌已不可见，但科学家仍在研究数据，其真实身份可能长期保持神秘。"
        },
        "key_details": [
          {
            "source_ids": [
              "s17"
            ],
            "meaning": "奥陌陌现在从地球上看不到。"
          },
          {
            "source_ids": [
              "s18"
            ],
            "meaning": "天文学家继续研究从它那里获得的信息。"
          },
          {
            "source_ids": [
              "s20"
            ],
            "meaning": "奥陌陌很可能在未来很多年里都是一个谜。"
          }
        ],
        "function": {
          "type": "conclusion"
        },
        "relation_to_previous": {
          "type": "summary",
          "target": "p3"
        },
